[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Given this analysis, option 6) Increasing oligosaccharide-based prebiotics only appears to be the most directly associated with enhancing anti-CRC chemotherapy by increasing butyric acid-producing bacteria in the gut.
