[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m [34mℹ[0m [1m[34m[QUESTION][0m Advances in nanotechnology and molecular biology have led to the development of targeted antimicrobial strategies and personalized medicine. These innovations often leverage engineered nanoparticles, polymer platforms, and genetic insights to enhance efficacy while minimizing risks.
