[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Which strategy directly enhances the antibacterial potency of chitosan nanoparticles against gastrointestinal pathogens while maintaining biodegradability and safety?
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1) Functionalization with gold nanoparticles for improved imaging   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Loading with phenolic compounds to increase antimicrobial activity   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Incorporation of titanium dioxide for UV-activated disinfection   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Surface modification with carbon nanotubes for membrane disruption   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Encapsulation of CYP2C9 inhibitors for metabolic regulation   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Coating with silver ions for broad-spectrum bactericidal action   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Doping with zinc oxide to induce reactive oxygen species production
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Please provide your reasoning within <think></think> tags and the final answer within a \boxed{} block. The value inside the \boxed{} block should only be the number of the correct option. 
