[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4. **Conclusion:** Option 6, coating with silver ions, directly enhances antibacterial potency, provides broad-spectrum action, and maintains the biodegradability and safety of chitosan nanoparticles when properly coated and controlled.
