[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m The characteristic that most distinguishes Scedosporium prolificans in disseminated melanized mold infections is its near-universal resistance to available antifungal agents and nearly 100% mortality in the absence of neutrophil recovery.
