[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m So maybe option4 and option7 are both important, but the question is about a critical step. If you don't perform melting curve analysis, you might not know if you have primer-dimers, leading to incorrect quantification. So option4 would be the critical step.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
