[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Substitution of residues outside N-terminal cleavage region: So LapG cleaves LapA at the N-terminus. If we change residues outside, does that affect cleavage? Probably not as much. So maybe not effective.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
