[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m The presence of multiple gene copies encoding hydroxylamine oxidoreductase allows for redundancy, which can buffer against gene loss and adapt to various conditions, contributing to functional diversification and regulatory adaptation in the ammonia oxidation pathway.
