[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1. The correct condition is that the user must give appropriate credit and verify that any third-party material is also covered by the CC BY 4.0 license or obtain separate permission.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2. Other options are incorrect because they either disregard third-party rights, impose unnecessary restrictions, or fail to account for the specific requirements when third-party material is involved.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
