[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT)   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Targeting lipopolysaccharides (LPS) in the gut   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Plant-derived polysaccharides from Chrysanthemum   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Herbal formulas like YYFZBJS
