[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m [34mℹ[0m [1m[34m[QUESTION][0m Microarray technology enables simultaneous measurement of gene expression levels across thousands of genes, using complex experimental protocols and statistical analyses to ensure accurate interpretation. Critical steps include sample labeling, hybridization, normalization, and validation of results using more sensitive methods like qRT-PCR.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
