[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m [34mℹ[0m [1m[34m[QUESTION][0m Members of the bacterial phylum Chlorobi were historically thought to be strictly anaerobic, non-motile, and obligate photoautotrophs. Recent discoveries have revealed new species within this group that demonstrate unexpected metabolic versatility and ecological adaptations.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Which feature most distinctly differentiates Ignavibacterium album from previously known green sulfur bacteria within the Chlorobi phylum?
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1) Possession of genes for photosynthetic pigment synthesis   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Ability to oxidize sulfur compounds for energy   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Flagellated motility and chemoheterotrophic metabolism   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Requirement for strictly anoxic (oxygen-free) environments   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Complete pathways for biosynthesis of all amino acids   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Obligate reliance on light-driven carbon fixation   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Exclusive isolation from marine sediments
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Please provide your reasoning within <think></think> tags and the final answer within a \boxed{} block. The value inside the \boxed{} block should only be the number of the correct option. So I should write \boxed{3} because the correct answer is option 3.
