[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Accumulation of lactobacillic acid in the plasma membrane   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Increased secretion of exopolysaccharides   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Enhanced malic acid uptake via malate permease   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Production of hydrogen peroxide as a stress signal   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Downregulation of ATPase activity   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Formation of endospores to survive harsh conditions
