[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Wait, I think when c-di-GMP is low, biofilms disperse. So c-di-GMP levels decrease upon biofilm dispersal. High c-di-GMP means more biofilms. So phosphate starvation would lead to lower c-di-GMP.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
