[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Which of the following interventions is most directly linked to both reshaping the gut microbiome and reducing inflammation as a chemopreventive strategy against colorectal cancer?
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1) Administration of broad-spectrum antibiotics   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Consumption of high-fat diets   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Use of natural compounds such as baicalein, ginseng, tea polyphenols, and curcumin   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Increased intake of saturated animal proteins   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Supplementation with synthetic vitamins only   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Exclusive reliance on surgical tumor removal   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Depletion of all dietary fiber from the diet
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
