[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Option 1: Only mice models, doses from 0.1 to 10 mg/kg. But essential oil research likely uses multiple models, not just mice. So this is probably not correct.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Option 2: Poultry, C57BL/6 mice, and silver catfish; doses from 7.5 mg/kg to 1 kg/ton. Silver catfish is a fish model, which is different. Dosing ranges seem to cover a broad spectrum, from smaller to larger animals. So this might be the right mix.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
