[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m So, the task is to determine which option explains why deleting oxyR leads to more sensitivity and why restoring a single downstream enzyme doesn't help. The key is that OxyR regulates multiple genes, so even restoring one won't be enough. So the correct answer is option 1.
