[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1) Performing transcriptomic analysis to identify genes upregulated under cold and salt stress   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Measuring cellular respiration rates using radiolabeled substrates at subzero temperatures   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Conducting Arrhenius-based calculations of growth rate constants at varying temperatures   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Analyzing fatty acid composition of membrane lipids in cells grown at different temperatures   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Assessing cell viability through optical density and colony counts in saline media   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Using electron microscopy to visualize cell morphology and ultrastructure changes   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Developing specialized growth media that remains liquid at -15°C for culture studies
