[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m But let me double-check. The question is about which statement is correct. The options are numbered 1 to 7.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m I think statement 1 says essential oils disrupt bacterial quorum sensing, preventing biofilm formation. Quorum sensing is a system bacteria use to coordinate actions, like when they reach a certain density they start forming biofilms.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m So if essential oils disrupt that, it makes sense they can prevent biofilms, thus inhibiting contamination. So option 1 is correct.
