[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Which characteristic most directly contributes to Caloramator celer's suitability for rapid, large-scale biofuel fermentation processes?
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 1) Ability to tolerate acidic pH during growth   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Possession of a large number of antibiotic resistance genes   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Optimal growth at high temperatures and alkaline pH with rapid doubling time   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Natural competence for DNA uptake and transformation   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Production of methane as a primary fermentation product   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Exclusive utilization of C5 sugars for metabolism   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Requirement for oxygen-rich conditions for biofuel production
