[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 2) Infrared spectroscopy, agar diffusion assay, and hemolysis test   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Mass spectrometry, disc diffusion, and in vivo mouse infection model   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Thin-layer chromatography, broth macrodilution, and LD50 determination in rodents   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) UV-Vis spectroscopy, E-test, and comet assay   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Gas chromatography, time-kill curve, and Ames mutagenicity test   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Optical rotation, Sabouraud agar streaking, and cell migration assay
