[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m [34mℹ[0m [1m[34m[QUESTION][0m In ecological modeling, the Generalized Lotka-Volterra (GLV) model is commonly used to simulate the interactions among multiple species, providing insights into stability, coexistence, and extinction scenarios. Advances in data sharing and open science have enhanced reproducibility and collaboration in microbiome and ecological research.
