[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m Looking at the options, method 1 is Gas chromatography and NMR spectroscopy. I know that NMR can identify different compounds, perhaps for fermentation products. Gas chromatography can separate volatile compounds, but I'm not sure if it can identify fermentation products. Alternatively, HPLC might be used for separating various compounds, including maybe storage polymers or fermentation products.
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 
