[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 3) Direct phosphorylation of acetyl-CoA   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 4) Hydrolysis of external polyphosphate reserves   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 5) Utilization of external nitrate as an electron acceptor   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 6) Conversion of glucose via glycolysis exclusively   
[36m(main_task pid=1434988)[0m 7) Direct import of extracellular trehalose
